risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
environment: pm-cli 2026.9.4 build at 751aa44c0
repro_steps: "Import buildCoreCommandProgram from the parity script, list each command option long name, and diff against resolveSubcommandFlagContractsForCommand plus the global flag contracts"
resolution: "Runtime flag parity now inventories every registered option before comparing SDK declarations, rejects missing flags and command resolvers, and propagates corrected contracts through CLI/MCP/completion. Explicit gate/container inclusion options carry governed help budgets; claim help is measured at 1836 bytes under its 2020-byte ceiling."
expected_result: "Shared SDK and CLI contracts preserve configured workflow semantics, trustworthy recovery evidence, bounded output and deterministic verification."
actual_result: "PR 1195 review corrections passed 210 focused tests and full coverage: 8422 tests in 608 files; statements 62222/62222, branches 47190/47190, functions 12920/12920, lines 59845/59845. Full typecheck and ESLint pass. Context evaluation including all token surfaces and the temporary Node/Bun SDK/CLI manual workflow pass. Hosted verification of this corrected head and publication remain subsequent claims."
affected_version: 2026.9.4
component: "scripts/release/flag-invocation-parity, sdk/cli-contracts/flag-contracts"
