  "2026-09-05T02:39:37.611Z","harness:codex","Delivery context: strict all-status CLI snapshot read 2638/2638 items with complete receipt, zero omissions and no unreadable documents. Reusing six canonical execution-loop owners; no new duplicate items. GitHub currently has no open PRs and zero open Dependabot/code-scanning/secret-scanning alerts; GH-1169 already links pm-u4t9gp. Only items under active implementation are claimed."
  "2026-09-05T02:42:15.341Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: regression first failed because undeclared command/options were silently discarded. Updated gate observes 3342 executable option occurrences across all 69 core command roots; all match declarations. Fixed canonical and alias invocation metadata and missing flag rows, including item root resolver. Nine focused tests pass. Historical merge flags already existed in this checkout and were preserved."
