  "2026-09-05T03:22:17.342Z","harness:codex",Contract census now includes pre-existing undeclared flags. Canonical command budgets expand only for newly inventoried flags; historical spelling inventory remains intact. next and claim help ceilings increase by 48 and 46 estimated tokens for two explicit execution-role opt-ins. Existing append body/text conflict validation is preserved by separate canonical source options.
  "2026-09-05T03:33:29.023Z","harness:codex","Security and dependency checks: current GitHub Dependabot, code-scanning and secret-scanning open alert inventories are empty; pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities across 425 total dependencies. Tracked-file credential scan and docs/skills gate pass. Live 14-day Sentry gate has zero blocking issues; required telemetry query reports 1.1 percent finish error rate and no failures lacking an error code. Final post-change operational proof remains separate."
  "2026-09-05T04:18:35.187Z","harness:codex","Replaced declaration-filtered flag observations with a complete runtime census, repaired missing contracts and item-root resolution, and regenerated SDK/MCP/help/completion declarations and governed budgets. Final local delivery evidence: pnpm quality:static passed; 8420 tests in 608 files passed with exact coverage statements 62214/62214, branches 47182/47182, functions 12920/12920, lines 59840/59840. Full typecheck, all six linked PM test runs, package-first dogfood (88 commands), temporary Node and Bun manual workflows, packed npm/npx/bunx consumers, compatibility migration, package artifact, docs/skills, SDK surface and contract checks passed. Refusal corpus closes 117/117 probes with negative controls; task-token corpus completes 8/8 tasks at 12667 estimated tokens. Tracker-context 41 assertions, graph-composition 10 assertions, and record-integrity pass. GitHub security inventories and pnpm audit are zero; fresh required Sentry/telemetry gate passes. PR review, merge, and publication remain separate subsequent claims."
  "2026-09-05T04:47:15.242Z","harness:codex","PR 1195 smoke gate measured claim help at 1836 bytes after two explicit gate/container selection options. Its sole byte ceiling is now ceil(1836*1.1)=2020, using the existing 10 percent governance policy. Every other surface ceiling is unchanged. This complements the reviewed flag and help-token census budgets."
  "2026-09-05T04:56:28.991Z","harness:codex","PR 1195 review corrections passed 210 focused tests and full coverage: 8422 tests in 608 files; statements 62222/62222, branches 47190/47190, functions 12920/12920, lines 59845/59845. Full typecheck and ESLint pass. Context evaluation including all token surfaces and the temporary Node/Bun SDK/CLI manual workflow pass. Hosted verification of this corrected head and publication remain subsequent claims."
  "2026-09-05T05:03:39.352Z","harness:codex","Reviewed delivery: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1195 . Final corrected source passed the complete pnpm quality:static suite after structured defect evidence and all terminal closures, full typecheck, 8422 tests / 608 files at exact 100/100/100/100, 55 token surfaces, and temporary Node/Bun manual workflows. All original review findings have explicit reactions and responses; three valid edge cases have reproduced red/green regressions and the pre-publication closure objection was withdrawn. GitHub dependency/code/secret alerts are zero. This source will now receive a fresh hosted review/check round; publication remains separate."
